      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HEADS UP (2) settled well back early on debut and always towards the tail to finish eighth (26.79) at Grafton over 450m. Look for sharp improvement here. COOL MIST (7) had the drop on the lead and went on to be beaten 6 lengths into second (17.55) at this track in a Maiden over 300m. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings four times from six starts. Ready to find winning form. CARBON FURY (1) form hasn't been great but has the inside draw. Last time finished 4th in a Maiden on September 30 over 300m at Taree Super Track behind Ripped Ritchie beaten 6 lengths (17.85). Comes through a solid form race last start. Key player if finds best. LONG BAY BLUE (5) has ability and can feature with the right run after missing a cheque here most recently.",
